      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3645e4d84539d774",
      "translationZh": "方案 1：Video2dataset",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2c1a8100bfa2298",
      "translationZh": "video2dataset 是一个开源项目 [link]，专注于分布式视频下载、转换以及将视频打包为不同的数据集格式。该项目原生支持 Slurm Workload Manager，因此我们可以在 CPU 集群上运行它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d31d3371d4518dc",
      "translationZh": "来源：Video2Dataset GitHub 页面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5552439c8f48c895",
      "translationZh": "由于我们所有的集群实例都通过同一个公网 IP 访问互联网，我们为该项目贡献了指定代理的功能，以便下载视频。虽然该功能尚未合并，但你可以使用我们的 PR [link] 为 video2dataset 打补丁，从而使用代理功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50c1063535139791",
      "translationZh": "方案 2：云端批处理作业。大多数云服务提供商都支持运行作业，只需指定执行每个作业的实例类型、定义一个队列，并提供一个包含待执行代码的容器即可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f85c7d340621a0fb",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 Google Cloud 和 AWS 运行一个定制的 docker 容器，通过 ytdlp 下载视频和元数据，并将结果推送到 S3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0266e3d890aeadcc",
      "translationZh": "构建 Docker 容器所需的文件可在此处找到 [code]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eebf980c14a54c7f",
      "translationZh": "我们的结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85d12fdd8fd44099",
      "translationZh": "虽然 Video2Dataset 配合代理可以正常运行，也允许我们执行额外的处理步骤，但我们每秒能够向代理发送的请求数成了瓶颈。这促使我们转向云端批处理作业。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bcc0ba8e609ec3b5",
      "translationZh": "保留动态内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f1fb9f2e0d27858",
      "translationZh": "在寻找最佳视频的过程中，我们将筛选范围缩小到既有画面动作、又有人以中快语速说话的内容。我们通过词密度过滤和视觉动态性过滤来实现这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c6a553a1a514665",
      "translationZh": "词密度过滤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2d5ca20ded2d7af",
      "translationZh": "我们用视频中的词密度作为音频动态性的替代指标。词密度的定义为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7ea9885f06ebe73",
      "translationZh": "词密度 = 隐藏式字幕中的词数 / 视频总时长（秒）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cedb39e894a967ac",
      "translationZh": "通过抽样并直观评估不同密度阈值下的内容质量，我们决定移除所有词密度低于 0.5 词/秒的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1889f03338b79bba",
      "translationZh": "示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05fd14ab3a8d469c",
      "translationZh": "词密度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d029f87e3d80f8fd",
      "translationZh": "示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fa11f0b2602da7f",
      "translationZh": "用于按文字密度进行筛选和查看示例的代码可在此处找到 [link]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d9199748e10cdc3a",
      "translationZh": "视觉动态程度筛选",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c2397e476a1ea54",
      "translationZh": "我们将 FFMPEG 的 Freezedetect 滤镜改用于判断视频的动态程度。虽然该滤镜原本用于识别视频中的冻结片段（多个相同帧连续排列），但通过将 noise 参数调到非常高的值，我们也能识别出运动幅度较小的片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecfd255016337494",
      "translationZh": "我们没有对整段视频运行 freezedetect，而是按时间片段分析视频，并根据被归类为静态的片段数量，通过投票判定视频是否为静态。通过人工评估，我们设定了一个阈值：如果所分析的片段中有 40% 的运动幅度较小，就丢弃该视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfb134d3ffdf4d78",
      "translationZh": "经过此项筛选后被丢弃的一些内容类型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baaddf70fb5d432b",
      "translationZh": "类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d029f87e3d80f8fd",
      "translationZh": "示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e8ada3c06dd002f",
      "translationZh": "配有音乐的静态图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc9e49ac71d45850",
      "translationZh": "演示文稿屏幕录制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e886f2bd7ffa5e6",
      "translationZh": "几乎静止不动、对着镜头讲话的人物",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "822cc50a6b3480d3",
      "translationZh": "用于按视频动态程度进行分类的 DockerFile 和代码可在此处找到 [link]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3af530a1d7c89ba",
      "translationZh": "在分析的 1.8M 个视频中，经过这一步，我们保留了 600K 个动态视频。在这一阶段，我们会更深入地挖掘视频内容，这对于确保数据集的多样性至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "15a00206ef5d7a03",
      "translationZh": "视频分类",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e935710c8204ef95",
      "translationZh": "为了选出尽可能多样化的内容，我们利用隐藏式字幕和 YouTube 元数据，对筛选后的 600K 个素材进行了分类。为了掌控分类过程，我们创建了一套分类体系，并引导标注过程遵循该体系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a3c742dba93c007",
      "translationZh": "自建分类体系",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fe3b4457fa3e599",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 GPT4-o 初步构建了这套自建分类体系，并由一位信息科学专家进行了审核和调整。该分类体系包含 126 个细分类别，并将它们按多个层级归并。这种多层级方法让 FineVideo 用户能够按其具体用例的需要选取数据集子集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cec6a9b65876e17",
      "translationZh": "该分类体系也提供 JSON 格式版本 [link]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcb8e92efa23f13b",
      "translationZh": "我们使用初版分类体系开始了内容标注，并在信息科学家的帮助下，根据内容标注的结果对分类体系进行了相应调整。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c0fad06865a54702",
      "translationZh": "内容标注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b238370d56eebd30",
      "translationZh": "我们使用通过 Text Generation Inference TGI 提供服务的 Llama 3.1 70B 对视频进行分类 [code]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ff1d2816677d87b",
      "translationZh": "提示词经过了多轮迭代，以确保回答严格限定为我们分类体系中的一个类别。在评估提示词的过程中，我们发现，从提示词中移除现有的 YouTube 标签和类别后，结果质量大幅提升：YouTube 元数据会使 Llama 3.1 生成的文本偏向 YouTube 提供的某个类别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3aa552480e4596b",
      "translationZh": "分类体系与内容标注的反馈循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8729c14d2467a2fc",
      "translationZh": "内容分类过程中的分类体系调整 信息科学家的职责之一是持续维护分类体系，在需要时添加新类别，或进一步细分类别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86e64491463dedf2",
      "translationZh": "使用大语言模型对内容进行分类，凸显了将分类体系的调整周期从数月或数年缩短至数小时的必要性。此外，在某些情况下，我们专门创建了一些类别，以剔除敏感视频，例如属于“枪支与武器”和“物质使用与毒品”类别的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0ce5cd19d2beb8d6",
      "translationZh": "贡献描述性元数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a5dfbc33d5577a7",
      "translationZh": "在流程的这个阶段，我们有三个视频级元数据来源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6285d180c6bc418c",
      "translationZh": "视频类别（使用 Llama 3.1 推断）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62531f3cb83821a3",
      "translationZh": "YouTube 元数据（标题、描述）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46e87fa75d8e811f",
      "translationZh": "来自 YouTube-Commons 的转录文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e87f841add1764af",
      "translationZh": "为了在视频理解领域作出贡献，我们决定更深入地研究时间码级元数据，例如活动、物体、叙事和剪辑方面的信息。我们曾考虑将人工标注作为主动学习流程的一部分，由一个或多个模型提出标注，再由人工进行质量检查。不过，正如我们将在接下来的章节中讨论的那样，我们发现 Gemini 是一个很好的解决方案，尤其是在我们对输入视频长度和输出格式加以限制时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bc5a2a8e077ee136",
      "translationZh": "长视频与 Gemini 1.5 Pro",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60b72b164ffaeb83",
      "translationZh": "我们进一步深入探索 Gemini 1.5 Pro，不断迭代提示词，并使用不同长度的内容进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15b37c610949ca06",
      "translationZh": "由于其上限为 1M tokens，大约相当于约 1 小时的视频，我们不得不舍弃时长超过 1 小时的视频。为解决这一问题，我们想到的一个办法是加速播放超过一小时的视频，从而使其能够装入 Gemini 的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecc597d7c89f7b10",
      "translationZh": "探索：通过加速视频，在 Gemini 的上下文中容纳更多内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c2a53e08028d864",
      "translationZh": "虽然从整体上看这似乎有效，但当我们开始查看细节时，我们发现只有视频的前几分钟得到了准确标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7db1c8b2b2050c8",
      "translationZh": "发现长视频的标注质量下降后，我们不禁思考：这个问题是否也影响了我们的其他视频？通过对不同时长的视频进行抽样，并检查标注对视频内容的覆盖情况，我们发现时长超过 10 多分钟的视频质量有所下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4164d8b98c2a0da4",
      "translationZh": "为了实现向社区回馈高质量数据的目标，我们舍弃了时长超过 10 多分钟的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0161",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "995df86bb0635370",
      "translationZh": "内容选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0162",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb7cfa943bdf23a9",
      "translationZh": "考虑到使用 Gemini 标注每小时视频的成本超过 $5，我们无法对筛选后保留的所有视频进行标注。因此，我们希望确保所有主题都有良好的覆盖，并在用于预训练后期 / 微调任务的内容多样性与预算之间找到合理的折中。我们将这一规模限制设定为 4K 小时的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0163",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fc26d59db8b6eba",
      "translationZh": "为了从 600K 个视频中选出 4K 小时的内容，我们设计了一种算法，在内容类别、用户互动和频道代表性之间取得平衡，以达到目标时长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0164",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59f22b10b49d3892",
      "translationZh": "算法流程图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0165",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ede66e763ecb5736",
      "translationZh": "内容选择算法的几个关键部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0166",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07a9cbc8e7e1cd98",
      "translationZh": "活跃度评分：我们将评论数、观看次数和点赞数按重要性加权组合，为每个视频计算互动指标。该评分有助于优先选择引起观众较好反响的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0167",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3af3479019a1847e",
      "translationZh": "视频选择：这一步通过迭代选择视频，以达到目标时长，同时确保多样性。它在高互动内容与不同类别和频道的代表性之间取得平衡，并使用惩罚机制，避免任何单一频道占比过高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0168",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "608bc44898787751",
      "translationZh": "最终调整：我们对选择结果进行调整，使其在不超过目标时长的前提下尽可能接近目标时长。具体做法是将所选视频按时长排序，并逐一添加到最终列表中，直到总时长尽可能接近目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0169",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49364826848d1f0e",
      "translationZh": "代码可在代码仓库 [link] 中找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0170",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bc819011ac871dc4",
      "translationZh": "使用 Gemini 1.5 Pro 进行标注，并使用 GPT4o 生成结构化输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0171",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0f7f9dff25413d8",
      "translationZh": "为什么要使用结构化数据？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0172",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "095c69fa5bf8346b",
      "translationZh": "我们开发 FineVideo 的目标之一，是通过提供结构化数据来赋能社区：如果你正在研究多模态大语言模型，可以对数据进行切分，并决定哪些类别适合纳入你的预训练或微调数据组合。如果你更关注计算机视觉，也可以直接使用该数据集，根据 FineVideo 中包含的数值类别（如动态程度评分、场景边界或音视频相关性评分）来训练分类器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0173",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06f0832f0c4c1edb",
      "translationZh": "结构化数据与 Gemini 1.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0174",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6331057ec8cd76c",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 1.5 Pro 支持通过提供模式来生成基于 JSON 的输出。我们探索了这一功能，并很快发现了两个问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0175",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01a8fab9480fdb99",
      "translationZh": "我们无法将原始模式放入 Gemini，因为我们的模式极其复杂。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0176",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7e1b66746f30195",
      "translationZh": "当我们尝试使用稍微简单一些、但仍然相当复杂的模式时，Gemini 的结果质量大幅下降：大部分场景类数据（角色、活动、道具）都丢失了。我们尝试将提示词拆分成多个提示词，并将不同的提示词与模式的不同部分相匹配，但收效甚微。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0177",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "008ba0badbdfd995",
      "translationZh": "我们的观察与其他研究人员的经历完全一致：添加具体的模式约束可能会降低性能。（《让我自由表达？关于格式限制对大语言模型性能影响的研究》）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0178",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff15353fd5ba185b",
      "translationZh": "我们的解决方案是先用 Gemini 1.5 生成自由文本，再增加第二个处理步骤，将 Gemini 的结果与我们的模式对齐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0179",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ff973176c962cf7",
      "translationZh": "我们使用的 Gemini 提示词如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0180",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b97274c3e8a6a08",
      "translationZh": "引入 Instructor",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0181",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6d811a679b40dd8",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 处理完结果后，我们使用 Instructor 对其进行解析：这是一个基于 Pydantic 构建的库，可以根据给定的模式生成结构化输出。示例见下表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0182",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0f000ae61260662",
      "translationZh": "Instructor 使我们能够尝试不同的模型，将 Gemini 输出的自由文本转换为我们在 Pydantic 中定义的模式。我们尝试了 Gemini 和 GPT4o，最终选择了 GPT4o，因为它的成功率更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0183",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d534be829e32196b",
      "translationZh": "视频",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0184",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b041171dc59bb1fc",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0185",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b2d5e58834ec02f",
      "translationZh": "Instructor 输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0187",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5757e5e849d18eab",
      "translationZh": "角色列表：男子 身材瘦削，棕色眼睛，两侧头发剃短，身穿带有彩色标志的黑色连帽衫和黑色裤子。场景 场景 1 开始 0:00 结束 0:55 角色：[男子] 活动：介绍巴士 描述有牛群的宁静地点 道具：巴士、牛群、露台。氛围：兴奋、冒险。叙事推进：介绍巴士。参观从外部开始，突出自然与放松。动态程度评分 0.7 音画相关性 1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0188",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "700e499b1c849f61",
      "translationZh": "{ \"title\": \"Bertie 巴士之旅\", \"description\": \"改装巴士导览。\", \"characterList\": [ { \"name\": \"讲述者\", \"description\": \"身材瘦削，棕色眼睛，两侧头发剃短，身穿带有彩色标志的黑色连帽衫和黑色裤子。\" } ], \"scenes\": [ { \"sceneId\": 1, \"title\": \"巴士介绍\", \"timestamps\": { \"start\": \"0:00\", \"end\": \"0:55\" }, \"cast\": [\"讲述者\"], \"activities\": [ \"讲述者在巴士前讲话\", \"展示摆有椅子的户外露台，附近有牛群。\" ], \"props\": [\"巴士\", \"露台\", \"牛群\"], \"mood\": \"兴奋、冒险。\" } ], \"dynamismScore\": 0.7, \"audioVisualCorrelation\": 1 }",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0189",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc2a58c18781e918",
      "translationZh": "值得强调的是，Gemini 的内容过滤机制滤掉了一些视频，因为你在使用 Gemini 时也可能遇到这种情况。在我们的案例中，考虑到我们计划处理的内容量，被 Gemini 过滤机制滤掉的内容总时长可以忽略不计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0190",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cf2312fb2f3848e",
      "translationZh": "用于标注视频的完整代码可在此处找到 [link]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0191",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9e605936c3c38fd6",
      "translationZh": "精细对齐与异常过滤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0192",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a79cea7422166611",
      "translationZh": "完成视频标注并将数据正确对齐到我们的模式后，我们会检查数据的时间维度，并确保其与视频对齐：Gemini 1.5 以每秒 1 帧的速率读取视频，而视频通常每秒有 25 - 29 帧。在精细对齐过程中，我们确保 Gemini 1.5 提供的场景边界与视频中的正确帧相匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0193",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8531b6f3b134f4d",
      "translationZh": "我们还利用这种时间对齐来剔除 Gemini 不再提供有用数据、导致部分视频被错误标注的情况。请注意，由于在流水线的早期阶段就丢弃了所有时长超过 10+ 分钟的内容，数据质量不佳的视频数量可以忽略不计（低于 0.5%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0194",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0e2919bfeeadcc8",
      "translationZh": "精细元数据——通过将视频场景边界与镜头对齐来剔除离群值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5be5ffaac0979ff3",
      "translationZh": "视频对齐代码链接见此处 [link]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0196",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "488d8ecb1a33fb01",
      "translationZh": "未来工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0197",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9659667add144e05",
      "translationZh": "我们目前正在筹备使用 FineVideo 训练一个多模态大语言模型，计划在训练完成后尽快向社区分享模型权重和训练方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0198",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e02d4e8d80df357",
      "translationZh": "我们也欢迎对 FineVideo 进行其他扩展，请畅所欲言，告诉我们您希望看到什么！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
